WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I looked at myself before coming here

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,280
No capital to sell oneself

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,280
Then work hard

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,340
Do what you can do Jian Tong

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:12,420
Shouldn't the children of Simple Jane Fairy Tales be right?

6
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:14,340
I will name my child this

7
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:19,100
Your parents should love you very much. I don’t have any family.

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,100
Make a copy of your ID card, Jian Tong

9
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,900
Do you know why I made an exception to accept you?

10
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,660
You said it well

11
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,400
Sell it if you can

12
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,240
If you can't sell it, just accept your fate.

13
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,080
Do what you can do

14
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,780
How many people are twice your age?

15
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:39,220
I still don’t understand this truth, so I’m missing out.

16
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,060
Drilling hard and thinking that one is fighting against the wind

17
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,980
In fact, it’s just high-minded and low-handed.

18
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,080
Never see clearly

19
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,520
What kind of onion am I?

20
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:49,780
Are you willing to prove yourself

21
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,220
Understand what you can do

22
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:54,260
I believe in a person who knows what he can do

23
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,460
He also understands something

24
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:56,580
It's something you can't do by yourself

25
00:00:58,170 --> 00:01:00,690
You know Donghuang is not an ordinary entertainment club.

26
00:01:01,170 --> 00:01:02,130
My voice is ugly

27
00:01:02,450 --> 00:01:05,040
Xiaojiang who doesn’t speak casually

28
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,800
I hired a cleaner

29
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,040
Take him to the staff dormitory

30
00:01:10,290 --> 00:01:11,450
Come to work tomorrow
